WEBVTT

00:09:58.220 --> 00:10:00.511
We don't have to stay stuck
in old ideas about prison.

00:10:00.511 --> 00:10:02.975
We can define that. We can create that.

00:10:02.975 --> 00:10:05.425
And when we do that thoughtfully and with humanity,

00:10:05.425 --> 00:10:07.362
prisons can be more than the bucket

00:10:07.362 --> 00:10:08.951
for failed social policy.

00:10:08.951 --> 00:10:12.301
Maybe finally, we will earn our title:

00:10:12.301 --> 00:10:14.296
a department of corrections.

00:10:14.296 --> 00:10:16.396
Thank you.

00:10:16.396 --> 00:10:18.927
(Applause)